nt":true,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":87,"wave":4,"rank":"global","omenStage":2,"omenDay":59,"present":true,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":88,"wave":4,"rank":"global","omenStage":2,"omenDay":59,"present":true,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":89,"wave":4,"rank":"global","omenStage":2,"omenDay":59,"present":true,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":90,"wave":4,"rank":"global","omenStage":2,"omenDay":59,"present":true,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":91,"wave":4,"rank":"global","omenStage":2,"omenDay":59,"present":true,"pend":false,"pendMid":null}],"milestones":{"wave4Day":48,"regionalDay":47,"omenStartDay":50,"omenStage1Day":54,"omenStage2Day":59,"firstPresentDay":59,"lastPresentDay":91,"sampleCount":91},"transcript":["A woman, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Dmitri heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 50s waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A woman, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 40s, with tattooed arms heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Dmitri heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Thornfield. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Lena waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","👥 DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Spool: Feed it nothing. It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence. (Olivia lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Feed it nothing — It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence.","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Malik waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","👥 Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Malik waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Leo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Hannah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🍲 Haven opens the granary — 4,438 kcal, all it holds. An honest feast, not a grand one. They count it anyway. (Trust +9 with each — 3 grieving fire(s); theirs waits.)","👥 Caleb heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Hannah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Wren waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Ashford with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Leo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Leo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Maya waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","◈ THE TABLE IS SET. A ring of pale light waits — take your seat from Haven when you are ready. Nothing is final until you sit.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Hannah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""],"heraldLines":[{"day":4,"line":"Ghada is quiet for a long moment. Then, all in a rush: “Fine. It’s true. Not line cook — truck driver. I lied because the truth felt small.” The admission hangs there, and the village — to its credit — doesn’t pounce."},{"day":5,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":6,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over a vast tangle of vines with huge leaves, roots like buried logs, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":8,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":8,"line":"🍽️ Alfredo stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":9,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":12,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":12,"line":"🍽️ Victor stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":20,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":23,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":23,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over a climbing vine with heart-shaped leaves and knobby white tubers underground, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":24,"line":"🍽️ Victor stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":30,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":33,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":38,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":41,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":41,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over a climbing vine with heart-shaped leaves and knobby white tubers underground, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":46,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":49,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":51,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over broad oval ribbed leaves flat to ground, tall thin seed spikes, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":53,"line":"\"Siobhan's gone.\" Alfredo looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Siobhan.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":54,"line":"📻 The old ones point at the horizon and don't speak. The System, for once, is quiet too. Then: the Herald. It heralds the apocalypse the way dawn heralds the day."},{"day":58,"line":"\"DeShawn's gone.\" Olivia looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not DeShawn.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":59,"line":"🗺️ Scouts found its lair — tile 8,4. THE HERALD — the sky, getting bigger. It is WAITING. You cannot face it alone. Sound the call."},{"day":59,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Emberhold in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":59,"line":"\"Alfredo's gone.\" Onni looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Alfredo.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":61,"line":"🍽️ Aroha stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":63,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over a tall leaning palm, green nuts clustered under the crown, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":64,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,140 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":68,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over a tall leaning palm, green nuts clustered under the crown, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":69,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,310 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":69,"line":"\"Olivia's gone.\" Ghada looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Olivia.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":69,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over broad leaves standing tall above still water on stiff stalks, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":70,"line":"\"Dmitri's gone.\" Onni looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Dmitri.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":71,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":72,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over a small tree with yellow heart-shaped fruit covered in soft fleshy spines, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":72,"line":"🍽️ Nino stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":73,"line":"The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"day":73,"line":"🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (The Big Stare, Extended Warranty, The Herald) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! The palisade's stakes take their toll as they come over the wall."},{"day":73,"line":"🐗⚠️ One of them is bigger than the usual teeth at the door — The Herald came with this raid, and the wall was not built for its kind."},{"day":73,"line":"🚨 The Big Stare, Extended Warranty, The Herald is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs."},{"day":73,"line":"Nobody met The Herald — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off."},{"day":74,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Emberhold in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":74,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":74,"line":"\"Ghada's gone.\" Victor looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Ghada.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":74,"line":"🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,380 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk."},{"day":74,"line":"🔍 Leo crouches over tall shrub with white flower clusters, dark purple-black berry clusters, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":75,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Herald. It's here."},{"day":75,"line":"The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"day":75,"line":"🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,000 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk."},{"day":76,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":76,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":76,"line":"The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"day":76,"line":"🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,200 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk."},{"day":77,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":77,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":77,"line":"The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"day":77,"line":"🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,126 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk."},{"day":78,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":78,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":78,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":78,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":78,"line":"The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"day":78,"line":"🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,356 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk."},{"day":79,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Thornfield in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":79,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":79,"line":"The Herald stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there."},{"day":79,"line":"🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 800 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk."},{"day":79,"line":"🗣️ Thabo to Aroha, by the fire: \"It eats while we deliberate. The Herald feeds on our stores and we're supposed to just... wait?\""},{"day":80,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":80,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":80,"line":"The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"day":80,"line":"🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (The Herald, Drum-Belly, The Ugly Beast) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! The palisade's stakes take their toll as they come over the wall."},{"day":80,"line":"🐗⚠️ One of them is bigger than the usual teeth at the door — The Herald came with this raid, and the wall was not built for its kind."},{"day":80,"line":"🚨 The Herald, Drum-Belly, The Ugly Beast is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs."},{"day":81,"line":"🩸 The Herald mauled Leo (-39 health) over 2 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing."},{"day":83,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 1,860 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":84,"line":"🔍 Leo crouches over a big shrub with flat plates of white flowers, later drooping clusters of black berries, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":85,"line":"The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"day":85,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":87,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":87,"line":"The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"day":87,"line":"🔍 Hannah crouches over a tall plantation tree with three-part leaves and three-lobed pods that explode, flinging large mottled seeds, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":88,"line":"🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (Drum-Belly, The Herald, Buffering) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! The palisade's stakes take their toll as they come over the wall."},{"day":88,"line":"🐗⚠️ One of them is bigger than the usual teeth at the door — The Herald came with this raid, and the wall was not built for its kind."},{"day":88,"line":"🚨 Drum-Belly, The Herald, Buffering is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs."},{"day":88,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Herald: Read the omens — reposition freely. It announces everything — read the omens. It is slow: reposition freely, never trade blows standing still. (It is a tutorial — the real test comes later. Learn it here, cheap.) (Hannah lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)"},{"day":88,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Read the omens — reposition freely — It announces everything — read the omens. It is slow: reposition freely, never trade blows standing still. (It is a tutorial — the real test comes later. Learn it here, cheap.)"},{"day":89,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,170 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":89,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":89,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":89,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":89,"line":"It followed you. The Herald is here."},{"day":89,"line":"The Herald stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there."},{"day":89,"line":"🩸 The Herald mauled Hannah (-45 health) over 2 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing."},{"day":90,"line":"🩸 The Herald mauled Leo (-42 health) over 2 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing."},{"day":90,"line":"🔍 Hannah crouches over a towering fan palm, black and straight as a pillar, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":91,"line":"\"THE HERALD came. Named and located — the war council knew its face. They faced Big-Eyes and lived to sit here. They faced The Loud Beast and lived to sit here. 2 more of the later drafts faced besides. Even now the wave-5 bar reads: blood your fighters (1 of 2 veterans).\" — the System is still reading the list."}],"instrumentTranscripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":78,"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"instrumentErrors":[],"interceptorErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":48,"w5Day":null,"national":1,"table":1,"won":1,"days":91,"gameDays":91,"endReason":"over-other","endScaleRank":"global","endRank":"global","endOmen":{"stage":2,"day":59},"endLinks":3,"endPend":false,"endPendMid":null,"deaths":[{"day":3,"kind":"monster","who":"mirrormoth","ca