ndMid":null},{"day":88,"wave":4,"rank":"regional","omenStage":0,"omenDay":86,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":89,"wave":4,"rank":"regional","omenStage":0,"omenDay":86,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":90,"wave":4,"rank":"regional","omenStage":0,"omenDay":86,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null}],"milestones":{"wave4Day":84,"regionalDay":67,"omenStartDay":86,"omenStage1Day":null,"omenStage2Day":null,"firstPresentDay":null,"lastPresentDay":null,"sampleCount":90},"transcript":["A woman, maybe 30s, with thick glasses heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s, with thick glasses heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 40s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Brian heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Yara heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Yara heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Benoit heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Farid heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","Priya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Yara heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Farid heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Leonard heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Yerlan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Leonard heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Farid heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Saud heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Betty heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Saud heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Yara heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","Yerlan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Benoit heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Malik waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Saud heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Betty heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Leonard heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","🔥 The fire settles. Brian has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Tick — I put it down today.\" \"It waits. The questing legs wave — the tell.\" \"Adjacent = attached. No dodge. It's ON you.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Raj says \"Say that again — slower.\" Yara breathes \"We've been walking past those.\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's thinking: \"So — what are we calling it?\"","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Malik waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Nora waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Yara leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Nightlight. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Nightlight: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Darius waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nao heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Priya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Leroy heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Liam heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Liam heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Priya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Nao heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Spool: Feed it nothing. It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence. (Zoltan lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Feed it nothing — It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Zoltan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Miriam heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Gavel: Confess first — take the lighter verdict. It accuses, waits a full round, then the verdict falls. Confess first — out loud, where everyone can hear — and the verdict falls lighter. But witnesses remember the confession; it is on the record. (Jovan lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Confess first — take the lighter verdict — It accuses, waits a full round, then the verdict falls. Confess first — out loud, where everyone can hear — and the verdict falls lighter. But witnesses remember the confession; it is on the record.","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Yara heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Yara heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","◈ THE TABLE IS SET. A ring of pale light waits — take your seat from Haven when you are ready. Nothing is final until you sit.","👥 Zoltan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""],"heraldLines":[{"day":4,"line":"🔍 A crouches over a fast-growing tree dropping dark purple berries that stain the ground, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":7,"line":"🔍 Leonard crouches over a weed with trumpet flowers and spiny round p