watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Tom heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A person, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Gael heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Gael heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Petra heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Devon waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Isaac heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Gael heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tom heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Petra heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sandra heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Devon waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Priya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","Ellis waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Thornfield with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Isaac heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tom heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Amara waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Carlos heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Devon waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Leo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Priya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Desmond heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Lucia waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with n