\"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Priya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tom heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Petra heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Desmond heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."],"heraldLines":[{"day":2,"line":"🔍 A crouches over white umbrella flowers over hollow purple-streaked stems in the marsh, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":3,"line":"🔍 A crouches over white umbrella flowers over hollow purple-streaked stems in the marsh, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":7,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":10,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":12,"line":"🍽️ Petra stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":12,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":15,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":17,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"day":26,"line":"🍽️ Tom stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":28,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":30,"line":"The moment passed. Nobody mentions the pods today. A few people notice that nobody mentions them."},{"day":31,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":32,"line":"🔍 Leo crouches over lacy white flower heads on tall stems; thin pale roots, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":35,"line":"🍽️ Pedro stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":38,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":41,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":42,"line":"The moment passed. Nobody mentions the pods today. A few people notice that nobody mentions them."},{"day":44,"line":"Sandra is quiet for a long moment. Then, all in a rush: “Fine. It’s true. Not EMT — Fisherman. I lied because the truth felt small.” The admission hangs there, and the village — to its credit — doesn’t pounce."},{"day":47,"line":"🍽️ Pedro stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":48,"line":"🍽️ Petra stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":49,"line":"🔍 Leo crouches over a pale pointed shoot pushing up through leaf litter, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":55,"line":"🔍 Desmond crouches over a tree with feathery leaflets and pale green round fruit, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":62,"line":"✨ ALIEN LOOT: Titan Belt. The buckle is a gear from a machine you broke. It fits. It's on the body — search it."},{"day":63,"line":"Taken: Teeth x3, Titan Belt x1."},{"day":65,"line":"🔍 Leo crouches over a fast leafy green, sometimes reddish stems, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":66,"line":"🔍 Leo crouches over a tall weed with star-shaped leaves and spiny pods holding beautiful mottled beans, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":75,"line":"🔍 Leo crouches over a clump of giant grass; after rain, pale spears push up, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":78,"line":"The moment passed. Nobody mentions the pods today. A few people notice that nobody mentions them."},{"day":81,"line":"🔍 Leo crouches over a massive bottle-trunked tree, branches like roots against the sky, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":83,"line":"\"Jessica's gone.\" Sandra looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Jessica.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."}],"instrumentTranscripts":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"interceptorErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":62,"w5Day":null,"national":1,"table":0,"won":0,"days":84,"gameDays":84,"endReason":"village-lost","endScaleRank":"national","endRank":"national","endOmen":null,"endLinks":3,"endPend":false,"endPendMid":null,"deaths":[{"day":21,"kind":"person","who":"gen_v3qmhhu","cause":"ambush","player":false},{"day":23,"kind":"monster","who":"hushwolf","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":27,"kind":"monster","who":"hushwolf","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":28,"kind":"monster","who":"white_noise_heron","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":30,"kind":"monster","who":"mirrormoth","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":32,"kind":"monster","who":"lockpick_raccoon","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":34,"kind":"monster","who":"cliffhanger","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":34,"kind":"monster","who":"cliffhanger","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":41,"kind":"monster","who":"moderator","cause":"combat","player":fa