2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":71,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":72,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":73,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":74,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":75,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":76,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":77,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":78,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":79,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":80,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":81,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":82,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":83,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":84,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":85,"wave":2,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":86,"wave":2,"rank":"national","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":87,"wave":2,"rank":"national","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":88,"wave":2,"rank":"national","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":89,"wave":2,"rank":"national","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null}],"milestones":{"wave4Day":null,"regionalDay":55,"omenStartDay":null,"omenStage1Day":null,"omenStage2Day":null,"firstPresentDay":null,"lastPresentDay":null,"sampleCount":89},"transcript":["A man, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s, with a slouched posture heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A person, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A person, maybe 60s, with calloused knuckles heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 40s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 40s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A person, maybe 60s, with a buzz cut heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Inkar heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Inkar heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Liam heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Anh heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Inkar waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Inkar heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Anh heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Mason heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Norman heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Inkar waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Norman heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Mason heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","Inkar heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Tashi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Inkar waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","📓 Codex: First link formed with Thornfield. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Norman heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🔥 The fire settles. Aroha has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Tick — I put it down today.\" \"It waits. The questing legs wave — the tell.\" \"Adjacent = attached. No dodge. It's ON you.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Nora breathes \"We've been walking past those.\" Stan breathes \"Did it look at you? Before?\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's thinking: \"So — what are we calling it?\"","Norman leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Nightlight. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Nightlight: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ben waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Inkar waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tariq waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Inkar waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Inkar waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tariq waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Inkar waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Inkar waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Kenji waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Inkar waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\""],"heraldLines":[{"day":3,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over a giant herb with huge paddle leaves and hanging hands of curved yellow-green fruit, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":3,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":5,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over a trailing vine with three-part leaves and long thin pods, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":6,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":8,"line":"Aroha is quiet for a long moment. Then, all in a rush: “Fine. It’s true. Not Denver — Auckland, New Zealand. I lied because the truth felt small.” The admission hangs there, and the village — to its credit — doesn’t pounce."},{"day":9,"line":"Mid-conversation, the air went still. Everyone was listening — really listening — for just a moment. Then someone coughed."},{"day":11,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":14,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":14,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":17,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":20,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":23,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":23,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":24,"line":"🔍 Tashi crouches over a spreading tree with pear-shaped juicy fruit, each one carrying a kidney-shaped nut underneath, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":27,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":27,"line":"🔍 Aroha crouches over a trailing vine with three-part leaves and long thin pods, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":29,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":33,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":33,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each