pendMid":null},{"day":88,"wave":4,"rank":"regional","omenStage":0,"omenDay":85,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":89,"wave":4,"rank":"regional","omenStage":1,"omenDay":85,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":90,"wave":4,"rank":"regional","omenStage":1,"omenDay":85,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":91,"wave":4,"rank":"regional","omenStage":1,"omenDay":85,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":92,"wave":4,"rank":"regional","omenStage":1,"omenDay":85,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null}],"milestones":{"wave4Day":81,"regionalDay":60,"omenStartDay":85,"omenStage1Day":89,"omenStage2Day":null,"firstPresentDay":null,"lastPresentDay":null,"sampleCount":92},"transcript":["A woman, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A person, maybe 60s, with restless hands waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A woman, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It won't leave its bed — that's the whole trick. Pressed, it darts to the center and waits. Reach down and take it, or fish the bed with a worm.","A woman, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Stella heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s, with deep-set eyes heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","👥 Addison heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sierra leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Nightlight. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Nightlight: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Sofia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Sofia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Stanisław heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Addison heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Stella heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Yuki heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Lena heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Sofia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Sierra waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Amina heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Wei heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","👥 Sofia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Yuki heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Stanisław heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Klaudia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Lena heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sierra waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","👥 Addison heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sierra heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Addison heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Klaudia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sierra waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Stella heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Yuki heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Addison heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","Klaudia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sierra heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sierra waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Addison heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Lena heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Yuki heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","◈ THE TABLE IS SET. A ring of pale light waits — take your seat from Haven when you are ready. Nothing is final until you sit."],"heraldLines":[{"day":3,"line":"🔍 A crouches over a low wiry shrub with dusty-blue berries that stain everything purple, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":4,"line":"🍽️ Amina stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":4,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":7,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":8,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":9,"line":"🔍 Klaudia crouches over a clustering palm with orange date-like fruits, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":11,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":16,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":16,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"day":17,"line":"🔍 Wei crouches over a spiny evergreen tree with plum-sized yellow-brown fruits, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":18,"line":"The moment passed. Nobody mentions the pods today. A few people notice that nobody mentions them."},{"day":19,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":22,"line":"🍽️ Klaudia stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":23,"line":"🔍 Klaudia crouches over low fan palms, serrated stems, clusters of blue-black berries, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":25,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":25,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"day":28,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":33,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":36,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":41,"line":"The moment passed. Nobody mentions the pods today. A few people notice that nobody mentions them."},{"day":41,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🔍 Sofia crouches over broad oval ribbed leaves flat to ground, tall thin seed spikes, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":43,"line":"🍽️ Lena stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":44,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":46,"line":"🔍 Wei crouches over lacy white flower heads on tall stems; thin pale roots, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":54,"line":"🔍 Yuki crouches over a weed with trumpet flowers and spiny round pods, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":56,"line":"Its wings hang open and dull — the light spent. For a moment, it's just a moth."},{"day":56,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":57,"line":"🔍 Sofia crouches over a tall weed with star-shaped leaves and spiny pods holding beautiful mottled beans, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":58,"line":"\"Wanjiru's gone.\" Klaudia looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Wanjiru.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":59,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":60,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"day":62,"line":"\"Sierra's gone.\" Klaudia looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Sierra.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":62,"line":"🔍 Klaudia crouches over rank-smelling weed with white trumpet flowers and spiny seed pods, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":63,"line":"🔍 Sofia crouches over a tall plantation tree with three-part leaves and three-lobed pods that explode, flinging large mottled seeds, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":64,"line":"🍽️ Amina stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":66,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":67,"line":"🍽️ Lena stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":69,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":72,"line":"🍽️ Wei stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":75,"line":"🍽️ Sofia stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":76,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":77,"line":"🔍 Yuki crouches over small understory tree, big drooping leaves, mango-sized green-yellow fruit, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":79,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":80,"line":"🗣️ Stella to Klaudia, by the fire: \"It eats while we deliberate. The Herald feeds on our stores and we're supposed to just... wait?\""},{"day":86,"line":"The moment passed. Nobody mentions the pods today. A few people notice that nobody mentions them."},{"day":89,"line":"📻 The old ones point at the horizon and don't speak. The System, for once, is quiet too. Then: the Herald. It heralds the apocalypse the way dawn heralds the day."},{"day":89,"line":"🔍 Yuki crouches over a fast tree with feathery leaves and bitter smell, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":89,"line":"🔍 Yuki crouches over a fountain of sharp-edged grass smelling of lemon, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":92,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":92,"line":"\"THE HERALD came. Named, not yet located. Even now the wave-5 bar reads: blood your fighters (1 of 2 veterans).\" — the System is still reading the list."},{"day":92,"line":"They are still there. Still small. Still waiting for someone to decide they matter more than the moment."}],"instrumentTranscripts":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"interceptorErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":81,"w5Day":null,"national":0,"table":1,"won":1,"days":92,"gameDays":92,"endReason":"over-other","endScaleRank":"regional","endRank":"regional","endOmen":{"stage":1,"day":85},"endLinks":2,"endPend":false,"endPendMid":null,"deaths":[{"day":8,"kind":"monster","who":"rut_king","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"monster","who":"nightlight_catfish","cause":"expedition","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"villager","who":"gen_yphpohe","cause":"the wild","player":true},{"day":13,"kind":"monster","who":"lockpick_raccoon","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":15,"kind":"monster","who":"murkcap","cause