,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":71,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":72,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":73,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":74,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":75,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":76,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":77,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":78,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":79,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":80,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":81,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":82,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":83,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":84,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":85,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":86,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":87,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":88,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":89,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":90,"wave":3,"rank":"regional","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null}],"milestones":{"wave4Day":null,"regionalDay":47,"omenStartDay":null,"omenStage1Day":null,"omenStage2Day":null,"firstPresentDay":null,"lastPresentDay":null,"sampleCount":90},"transcript":["A man, maybe 40s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A person, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 30s, with calloused knuckles heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Quinn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ruth heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Petra heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Earl heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Yuki heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ruth heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Ruth heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ivy heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Yuki heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Owen heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Carmen heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Ashford. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","Carmen heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","🔥 The fire settles. Owen has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Tick — I put it down today.\" \"It waits. The questing legs wave — the tell.\" \"Adjacent = attached. No dodge. It's ON you.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Yuki says \"Did it look at you? Before?\" Fionn asks \"Tell me you didn't go alone.\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's thinking: \"So — what are we calling it?\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ivy leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Big Stare. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Big Stare: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.","Wren waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nikolai heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Rosa waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Thornfield with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Maya waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Quinn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Theo waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Rosa waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Thornfield with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Rosa waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Thornfield with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","◈ THE TABLE IS SET. A ring of pale light waits — take your seat from Haven when you are ready. Nothing is final until you sit."],"heraldLines":[{"day":5,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":7,"line":"🔍 Yuki crouches over a low woodland plant with a whorl of compound leaves and a small cluster of red berries — rare, and protected, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":9,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":11,"line":"🔍 Ruth crouches over a forked palm with fan leaves and large brown gingerbread-smelling fruits, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":11,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":12,"line":"🔍 Ivy crouches over a tree with compound leaves and hard nuts, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":13,"line":"🍽️ Carmen stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":14,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":15,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"day":15,"line":"🔍 Owen crouches over oval nuts in scaly cups, scattered under the big lobed-leaf trees, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":16,"line":"🍽️ Ivy stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":17,"line":"🔍 Owen crouches over tall smooth stalks turning reddish-purple, with dark purple berry clusters in late summer, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":19,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":20,"line":"The moment passed. Nobody mentions the pods today. A few people notice that nobody mentions them."},{"day":22,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":23,"line":"🔍 Ivy crouches over a tall plant with dull purple bell flowers and shiny black cherry-sized berries, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":24,"line":"🔍 Owen crouches over a fountain of sharp-edged grass smelling of lemon, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":25,"line":"🔍 Ruth crouches over grass-like leaves with a sharp familiar smell when crushed, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":30,"line":"\"Stella's gone.\" Fionn looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Stella.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":35,"line":"🔍 Quinn crouches over a big shady tree; at dawn the ground beneath is strewn with fleshy cream flowers, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":39,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":39,"line":"Its throa