8,"line":"🍽️ Raj stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":92,"line":"🔍 Ella crouches over a slender fast-growing tree with feathery leaves and long hanging pods, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":96,"line":"\"Valentin's gone.\" Ashanti looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Valentin.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":99,"line":"\"Maya's gone.\" Fatima looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Maya.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":99,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":101,"line":"🔍 Wojciech crouches over giant rhubarb-like leaves, round burrs, first-year = leaf rosette with no stalk, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":102,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":105,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"day":105,"line":"🔍 Wojciech crouches over giant rhubarb-like leaves, round burrs, first-year = leaf rosette with no stalk, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":106,"line":"🍽️ Wojciech stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":115,"line":"🔍 Wojciech crouches over tall thorny canes, magenta flowers, salmon-colored raspberry-like berries, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":116,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":118,"line":"🍽️ Wojciech stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":119,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":119,"line":"🍽️ Alejandro stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":124,"line":"📻 The old ones point at the horizon and don't speak. The System, for once, is quiet too. Then: the Herald. It heralds the apocalypse the way dawn heralds the day."},{"day":129,"line":"🗺️ Scouts found its lair — tile 7,4. THE HERALD — the sky, getting bigger. It is WAITING. You cannot face it alone. Sound the call."},{"day":129,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Stonebridge in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":131,"line":"🍽️ Alejandro stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":134,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Stonebridge in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":135,"line":"🔍 Ella crouches over thorny climbing vines everywhere, with tender coiled tips in spring, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":136,"line":"🔍 Ella crouches over a shrub with small oval leaves and clusters of bright red berries on bare twigs, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"day":138,"line":"🍽️ Ella stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":139,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 0 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":139,"line":"🔍 Ella crouches over a big shady tree; at dawn the ground beneath is strewn with fleshy cream flowers, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"day":142,"line":"🍽️ Wojciech stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""},{"day":143,"line":"\"Diana's gone.\" Fatima looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Diana.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":144,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Thornfield in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":144,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"day":145,"line":"\"Ashanti's gone.\" Alejandro looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Ashanti.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"day":146,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"day":148,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"day":149,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 1,950 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":152,"line":"◈ THE WAR PATH — The body count, itemized. The System is not making this up — it was filming. THE HERALD came. Named and located — the war council knew its face. They faced Loud-Eyes and lived to sit here. They faced The Suburb and lived to sit here. Even now the wave-5 bar reads: blood your fighters (0 of 2 veterans)."},{"day":152,"line":"They are still there. Still small. Still waiting for someone to decide they matter more than the moment."}],"instrumentTranscripts":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"interceptorErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":116,"w5Day":null,"national":1,"table":1,"won":1,"days":151,"gameDays":152,"endReason":"over-other","endScaleRank":"national","endRank":"national","endOmen":{"stage":2,"day":129},"endLinks":3,"endPend":false,"endPendMid":null,"deaths":[{"day":7,"kind":"monster","who":"hummice","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"villager","who":"gen_8mnn7vp","cause":"the wil