ull,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":106,"wave":3,"rank":"global","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":107,"wave":3,"rank":"global","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":108,"wave":3,"rank":"global","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null},{"day":109,"wave":3,"rank":"global","omenStage":null,"omenDay":null,"present":false,"pend":false,"pendMid":null}],"milestones":{"wave4Day":null,"regionalDay":49,"omenStartDay":null,"omenStage1Day":null,"omenStage2Day":null,"firstPresentDay":null,"lastPresentDay":null,"sampleCount":109},"transcript":["A man, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A person, maybe 60s, with deep-set eyes heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s, with a wiry build waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Greta heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","A woman, maybe 30s, with a long braid heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s, with a wiry build heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s, with a wiry build heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Jamila heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Henry heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Henry heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Henry heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Jamila heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Henry heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Jamila waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Linh heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Jamila waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Zoe waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","Jamila waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Zoe waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nora waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, t